We rejoice for @FlavioBolsonaro, @NandaBolsonaro, and their children are safely in the United States! 

@POTUS couldn’t impact a reversal to the un-democratic Brazilian election, but we praise God @POTUS and @SecRubio have offered asylum here for their safety and well-being. 

Do not fear, Brazil! Keep praying and believing! Flavio will continue the fight here for a free Brazil! And we are all in to help! 🇺🇸🇧🇷 #flaviobolsonaro #brasil

